  "description": "Biological and physical-chemical hybrid systems for closing life support loops toward 99% mass recovery. Integrates the ESA MELiSSA five-compartment loop (photosynthetic, nitrifying, degrading, waste, consumer) with algae bioreactors (Chlorella, Spirulina), higher-plant chambers (wheat, soy, rice), and advanced water recovery to regenerate oxygen, water, and food from crew waste streams.",
